{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0444_1000_p", "source_sha256": "60c428c1924262b07faf038c49dc618fcd087702174db0b6b5ce698d603ad2aa", "ja": "（琴葉の新しい衣装が届いた。さっそく試着して\nもらったが……うん、ぴったりだ！）", "zh": "（琴叶的新衣服送到了。马上让她试穿了一下……嗯，非常合身！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0444_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "51e1aebf7e068fec0579739a8b5a0c51fae0c0188790e6162ea7e0658c80a848", "ja": "かわいい……とっても素敵です。\n{$P$}、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "好可爱……真的很漂亮。\n{$P$}先生，谢谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0444_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "e37cf9b283ce20a913c63cf4fb0783932c1358533d458945745f22c93c91e196", "ja": "でも……こういう衣装を着ると、\nちょっと緊張しちゃいますね。", "zh": "可是……穿上这样的服装，还是会有点紧张呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0444_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b29460c4caf4a2b845f7ca683dd699fd3594b3da6849e15571fcf503856e93e1", "ja": "そうなのか？", "zh": "是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0444_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "80c92f7b2adfee65833623e44037594668d8373726fa5783c7cc204f297e2ac8", "ja": "はい。きっと、気持ちの問題なんだと思います。\n身が引き締まる思いというか……。", "zh": "是的。我想，一定是心态上的问题吧。\n或者说……有种身体都紧绷起来的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0444_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "e7fb601970bad197f99febe63448383469d388d42675d2645bddea56553c635a", "ja": "今の私は、自分やみんなが憧れているようなアイドルに\nちゃんとなれてるかな、とか考えてしまって。", "zh": "我不禁会想，现在的自己是不是已经成为了那种让自己和大家都憧憬的偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0444_1006_p", "source_sha256": "78927eb3f7cd42aec1453b1ac69a17b4e31d0250ac2239f3ef785b2c23bded13", "ja": "琴葉らしいな。\n大丈夫、胸を張ってそう言えるアイドルになれてるよ。", "zh": "很有琴叶的风格啊。\n放心吧，你已经成为了能够挺起胸膛这样说的偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0444_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "08539d9b729c20c7ef40385ce63d66dbae667ca2d8012b0aa189a499b409a21b", "ja": "ふふっ、ありがとうございます。\nそう言ってもらえると、安心します。", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢您。\n听您这么说，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0444_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "815455a5dd16ce98e636b4750429ee8aa477f463de5a09d252165d2ccad40440", "ja": "その言葉に甘えすぎないように、\nこれからも努力を続けていきたいと思います。", "zh": "我会注意不太依赖您的这句话，今后也会继续努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0444_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2873c2169c845c1d2b3205d5d9d3bdcb2a340e53ce4bafd8cbce4b051e8bbbde", "ja": "ああ。でもたまには、\n後ろを振り返ってみるのもいいかもしれないぞ。", "zh": "啊。不过，偶尔回头看看，也许也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0444_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "cdabfb5ff4d8cd50e9119168ff60da5286589d74e04b3ea185664782d4b520be", "ja": "後ろ……\n初心忘るべからず、ということですか？", "zh": "身后……\n意思是说“不忘初心”吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0444_1011_p", "source_sha256": "66c914b7169d72f526d58ecc092719baa710217cd08b1699de19ea54cbcd135f", "ja": "いや、ちょっと違うかな。\n今まで琴葉が歩んできた道を思い出してほしいんだ。", "zh": "不，应该不太一样。\n我是想让你回想一下琴叶一路走来的路。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0444_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "cd41e1eda85f5ba9e241e9208e78d1e0cfbf44128d722013345fa95b937b0fc8", "ja": "私が歩んできた道……。", "zh": "我走过的路……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0444_1013_p", "source_sha256": "0eca4e1134dc462ea3f4ce50f0a24bf6b8ad9f414591e01cd4b58854c910c9b7", "ja": "そう。これからも今みたいに\n色々考えてしまうことがあるかもしれない。", "zh": "是啊，以后可能也会像现在这样，忍不住想很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0444_1014_p", "source_sha256": "22cc8ca3e22d4b0211ec46bf0414dadf7b4a2753ab7df19e19b4927bf405872c", "ja": "そんな時は、ゆっくり振り返るんだ。きっとこれまでの\n経験や努力が、琴葉の背中を押してくれると思う。", "zh": "那种时候，就慢慢回头看看吧。我想，琴叶至今为止的经历和努力，一定会在背后推你一把。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0444_1016_p", "source_sha256": "402a5333214c1dacf7d3e3701ef709dceeb864a7ed99727094c396bf0efac1f1", "ja": "琴葉？", "zh": "琴叶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0444_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "78567384442d4c20b515c7eb49eed44e96563a10ddcc1e9154c569ae5289caa1", "ja": "ふふっ、本当ですね。緊張がほぐれた気がします。\nそれに……。", "zh": "呵呵，确实呢。感觉紧张感都缓解了。\n而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0444_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "439f9ef0029a67758014bf06f993f59ddbf90260856576fbfcf1269e997c0216", "ja": "なんだか、さっきよりもずっと……前に向かって\n走りたい気持ちが強くなった感じもします！", "zh": "总觉得，比刚才更加强烈地……想要向前奔跑了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0444_1019_p", "source_sha256": "510404d4c35210c6131625e9fbe0cafd469120177f26316f20905878627da347", "ja": "おっと、気負わないでほしいと思ったんだけど。\nなんか逆効果だったみたいだな。", "zh": "哎呀，我本来是想让你别太紧绷的。看来好像起了反效果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0444_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "0ea66521bf739cf3cf897b0f93d78339a7cdb43aa207ba152ee64fba02972716", "ja": "そんなことありません。肩の力が抜けた分、\n思いきり走れるようになったというか……。", "zh": "没那回事。正因为放松了肩膀，反而能尽情奔跑了…… taamatut", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0444_1021_p", "source_sha256": "1fee69b7f3c5591fc0551d158501504dee6e22906609d406d039558a72e4f23b", "ja": "ははっ。それならよかった。", "zh": "哈哈，那就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0444_1022_017kth", "source_sha256": "9650a9ae7a9d783724c3613e189ac0ee5b1aa816fd20d793f316cd8dfc07eebb", "ja": "{$P$}が信じてくれるように\n私も、自分を信じます。", "zh": "为了让{$P$}相信我，\n我也要相信自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0444_1023_017kth", "source_sha256": "c554e7c94f5dfa1b4c0fe22ecd569c9a9b6666e5caae4154e5689e2640ecc4c9", "ja": "これからも、私が進む道を一緒に歩んでください。\nそして私のことを、見守ってくれると嬉しいです。", "zh": "今后也请和我一起走在我前进的道路上。\n如果您愿意一直守护着我，我会很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
